  "idea": "AI customer interview transcription and feature request clustering",
  "text": "This AI workflow transcribes customer calls and clusters repeated feature complaints automatically. Product managers spend entire Fridays re-listening to Zoom recordings and copy-pasting customer quotes into spreadsheets manually. Subjective note-taking creates confirmation bias, prioritizing loud individual clients over widespread product adoption blockers. Connect Fathom to Make to transcribe calls and group semantic complaints into prioritized Productboard themes. This eliminates product roadmap guesswork while saving twenty hours.",
